    <!-- Revenant -->
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.ImpostorRoles.Revenant">Revenant</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.ImpostorRoles.Revenant.IntroBlurb">Feign death, revive, then kill by contact.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.ImpostorRoles.Revenant.MedDescription">Feign death once.[nl]If no meeting starts before you return, activate Doom Awakening to move faster and attack the first non-impostor you touch.[nl]A meeting during feigned death kills you.[nl]Doom Awakening ends after one attack, when its timer runs out, or when a meeting starts.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.ImpostorRoles.Revenant.TabDescription">Feign death once. A meeting before you return kills you.[nl]After returning, activate Doom Awakening for speed and a contact attack.[nl]It attacks the first non-impostor you touch, then ends.[nl]The timer running out or a meeting also ends it.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.ImpostorRoles.Revenant.WikiDescription">Feign death once.[nl]If no meeting starts before you return, activate Doom Awakening to move faster and attack the first non-impostor you touch.[nl]A meeting during feigned death kills you.[nl]Doom Awakening ends after one attack, when its timer runs out, or when a meeting starts.</string>
