    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EgoistRole">Egoist</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EgoistRole.IntroBlurb">Survive suspicion, then persuade the meeting to eject your rival.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EgoistRole.MedDescription">Votes from other players build [color=#CC4D99]Ego[/color] if you survive the meeting.[nl]Once you have enough, publicly challenge another player. Get them ejected that meeting to win.[nl]Everyone can still vote for anyone or Skip. A failed challenge spends all your Ego.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EgoistRole.TabDescription">[color=#CC4D99]Ego:[/color] Receive votes and survive to charge your challenge.[nl][color=#CC4D99]Win:[/color] Challenge someone, then get them ejected that meeting.[nl]Everyone can vote normally. Failure spends all your Ego.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EgoistRole.WikiDescription">Votes from other players build [color=#CC4D99]Ego[/color] if you survive the meeting.[nl]Once you have enough, publicly challenge another player. Get them ejected that meeting to win.[nl]Everyone can still vote for anyone or Skip. A failed challenge spends all your Ego.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EgoistRole.Tab.Ego">&lt;size=65%&gt;Ego: &lt;color=#CC4D99&gt;{0}&lt;/color&gt;/{1}&lt;/size&gt;</string>
