    <!-- Energy Thief-->
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EnergyThief">Energy Thief</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EnergyThief.IntroBlurb">Every power leaves something to steal.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EnergyThief.MedDescription">Siphon a player to collect energy.[nl]If they use an ability while siphoned, you also collect its category and briefly disrupt their abilities in that category.[nl]Each player can give you energy once per round.[nl]Collect enough energy and different categories to reveal a Power Node.[nl]At the node, start Grid Breach and stay inside until the countdown ends to win alone.[nl]Leaving or a meeting interrupts the breach.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EnergyThief.TabDescription">Siphon players for energy, once per player each round.[nl]An ability used during Siphon gives its category.[nl]It briefly disrupts that player's matching abilities.[nl]Collect enough energy and categories to reveal a Power Node.[nl]Start Grid Breach there and stay inside until the timer ends to win.[nl]Leaving or a meeting interrupts the breach.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EnergyThief.WikiDescription">Siphon a player to collect energy.[nl]If they use an ability while siphoned, you also collect its category and briefly disrupt their abilities in that category.[nl]Each player can give you energy once per round.[nl]Collect enough energy and different categories to reveal a Power Node.[nl]At the node, start Grid Breach and stay inside until the countdown ends to win alone.[nl]Leaving or a meeting interrupts the breach.</string>
    <string name="NewMod.Roles.NeutralRoles.EnergyThief.Tab.Energy">&lt;size=65%&gt;Energy: &lt;color=#D96BFF&gt;{0}&lt;/color&gt;/{1}&lt;/size&gt;</string>
